# Allow-list: the build context contains only what the image is built from.
# Everything else (git history, CI files, tests, docs, examples, virtual
# environments, caches, build artifacts) is never sent to the Docker daemon.
*

!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!docker/
!docker/smoke_test.py

# ... minus caches and local artifacts inside the allowed directories
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/.DS_Store
**/*~
**/*.swp
